---
import ArrowRight from '@lucide/astro/icons/arrow-right'
import BadgeCheck from '@lucide/astro/icons/badge-check'
import Rings from '../components/Rings.astro'
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { FSESO_URL } from '../data/site.js'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="FSESO Certified Instructors"
  description="Why you should take your firearms safety course from a Chief Firearms Office designated FSESO instructor."
  eyebrow="FSESO Certified"
  heading="Train with a designated instructor"
>
  <Fragment slot="intro">Choose a Chief Firearms Office-certified instructor and examiner for your firearms safety training.</Fragment>

  <section class="card grid overflow-hidden nav:grid-cols-[300px_1fr]">
    <div class="relative grid min-h-[200px] place-items-center overflow-hidden bg-navy">
      <Rings class="size-[420px] text-steel/20" />
      <span class="relative grid size-32 place-items-center rounded-full border-4 border-steel bg-navy-deep text-center text-cream">
        <BadgeCheck size={30} class="mx-auto text-steel" />
        <span class="-mt-6 font-display text-xl font-extrabold tracking-[0.06em]">FSESO</span>
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="p-7 nav:p-10">
      <h2 class="section-title text-[28px]">Why certification matters</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3.5 body-text">
        <p>
          There are companies and individuals, not associated with the FSESO, who advertise online to provide firearms safety training courses.
          These persons are not certified by the Chief Firearms Office of Ontario to teach and test the Canadian Firearms Safety Courses.
        </p>
        <p>
          You should ensure you are dealing only with a Chief Firearms Office certified firearms instructor and examiner before registering for
          any courses or examinations. Ask the instructor or examiner if they are designated by the Chief Firearms Office of Ontario to be a
          firearms instructor and/or examiner.
        </p>
        <p>
          FSESO instructors are the only firearms safety instructors approved by the Chief Firearms Office of Ontario to instruct or provide
          testing for these courses for the purposes of an individual wishing to obtain their PAL.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a class="btn" href="/register">Register with us</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href={FSESO_URL} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Find an FSESO instructor <ArrowRight size={18} /></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
